== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Gnome Rogue who doesn't follow Bertoxxulous, you will have A note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Journey to the Abbey of Deep Musing, where [[Welno Tanboots]] awaits.  She is the Master Cleric of the Deep Muses.  Take this note to her, and she will instruct you further.

Upon handing the note to [[Welno Tanboots]]:

: [[Welno Tanboots]] says, 'Yes, I just knew you'd see it my way, Teddee. Anyway, welcome to our little part of Ak'Anon's underworld. We have to pay a high price to keep our small organziation hidden, which keeps us all busy around here.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Deep Muses]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Ak'Anon]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Scuffed Tunic*]]. Good luck, Rogue!

